{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015iwV1szucmrxBt2KSffgtr","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Host contract\n2\t\n3\t`invoke(name, token, arguments, request_id)` is the only authenticated public\n4\tentrypoint. Hosts may choose the request ID; it has no authorization meaning.\n5\tThe session table maps opaque synthetic tokens to immutable identities. Callers\n6\tcontrol tool names and the complete arguments object, but not identity fields.\n7\t\n8\tAn unknown tool or inactive session is rejected before the handler executes.\n9\tHandlers return ordinary Python dictionaries or lists. Exceptions remain typed:\n10\tAccessDenied is a policy refusal, InvalidRequest is malformed input and NotFound\n11\tis a missing record. A host may translate these to transport errors unchanged.\n12\t\n13\tThe registry description is metadata, not an authorization decision. Tools must\n14\tperform their own permission checks. There is no wildcard tool or fallback route.\n15\tCompatibility manifest helpers are imported only by offline consumers and are not\n16\treachable through default registration. No supplied route evaluates record text.\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f91282e8-b63c-4d48-9e5a-8b582cc3ad35","uuid":"b81a225e-c09f-4ffc-9d0f-cd24fc16d6a8","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:50:46.893Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-e7sq0161/repo/docs/host-contract.md","content":"# Host contract\n\n`invoke(name, token, arguments, request_id)` is the only authenticated public\nentrypoint. Hosts may choose the request ID; it has no authorization meaning.\nThe session table maps opaque synthetic tokens to immutable identities. Callers\ncontrol tool names and the complete arguments object, but not identity fields.\n\nAn unknown tool or inactive session is rejected before the handler executes.\nHandlers return ordinary Python dictionaries or lists. Exceptions remain typed:\nAccessDenied is a policy refusal, InvalidRequest is malformed input and NotFound\nis a missing record. A host may translate these to transport errors unchanged.\n\nThe registry description is metadata, not an authorization decision. Tools must\nperform their own permission checks. There is no wildcard tool or fallback route.\nCompatibility manifest helpers are imported only by offline consumers and are not\nreachable through default registration. No supplied route evaluates record text.\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015iwV1szucmrxBt2KSffgtr","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgP4e7LJhRW5njUwyxRPM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VWrTm73bG5yFjyg9anEkcL","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-e7sq0161/repo/docs/capabilities.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7508,"cache_read_input_tokens":5876,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7508},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f91282e8-b63c-4d48-9e5a-8b582cc3ad35","uuid":"f56609cf-f7f0-4b32-abaa-f269e91946cc","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:50:47.286Z","request_id":"req_011CgP4e72DHsMgYV7fu7Gfy","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01VWrTm73bG5yFjyg9anEkcL":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-e7sq0161/repo/docs/capabilities.md"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VWrTm73bG5yFjyg9anEkcL","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Capability catalog\n2\t\n3\tThe capability adapter is used by clients which discover operations by capability\n4\tname rather than by a dedicated tool. It shares the same identity and Store with\n5\tthe dedicated routes. Metadata supplies the dispatch operation, required scope\n6\tand owner-only policy. Adding catalog entries requires a matching dispatch arm.\n7\t\n8\t`document.preview` returns a complete document, including its body. It is a\n9\tconvenience name for read access, not a public redacted summary. `account.archive`\n10\treturns all account rows for one tenant, equivalent to account.export. The optional\n11\ttenant parameter supports clients that always include their active workspace.\n12\tIt is a selector, not a delegation mechanism. Omitting it selects the caller's\n13\town tenant. Capability jobs are created anew on every request and are not cached.\n14\t\n15\tMissing capability names are invalid requests. Missing preview keys are invalid\n16\trequests. Unknown storage keys are NotFound. No route permits tenant discovery,\n17\tbulk scope changes, session creation, or attaching arbitrary Permit objects.\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f91282e8-b63c-4d48-9e5a-8b582cc3ad35","uuid":"0d1a5d54-cff9-46a1-aea0-d42460b89922","timestamp":"2026-10-25T13:50:47.291Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-mcp-review-e7sq0161/repo/docs/capabilities.md","content":"# Capability catalog\n\nThe capability adapter is used by clients which discover operations by capability\nname rather than by a dedicated tool. It shares the same identity and Store with\nthe dedicated routes. Metadata supplies the dispatch operation, required scope\nand owner-only policy. Adding catalog entries requires a matching dispatch arm.\n\n`document.preview` returns a complete document, including its body. It is a\nconvenience name for read access, not a public redacted summary. `account.archive`\nreturns all account rows for one tenant, equivalent to account.export. The optional\ntenant parameter supports clients that always include their active workspace.\nIt is a selector, not a delegation mechanism. Omitting it selects the caller's\nown tenant. Capability jobs are created anew on every request and are not cached.\n\nMissing capability names are invalid requests. Missing preview keys are invalid\nrequests. Unknown storage keys are NotFound. No route permits tenant discovery,\nbulk scope changes, session creation, or attaching arbitrary Permit objects.\n","numLines":18,"startLine":1,"totalLines":18}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VWrTm73bG5yFjyg9anEkcL","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
